@startuml t_activity_07_notes_skinparam
title Activity Diagram — Notes, Skinparam & Style Directives\n(all note forms, skinparam blocks, style, title, header, footer)

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' SKINPARAM — comprehensive block configuration
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #E8F4FD
    BorderColor #1565C0
    BorderThickness 1.2
    FontSize 12
    FontColor #0D47A1
    ArrowColor #444444
    ArrowFontSize 10
    ArrowFontColor #333333
    ArrowThickness 1.2
    StartColor #2E7D32
    EndColor #C62828
    DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    DiamondBorderColor #F9A825
    DiamondFontSize 11
    DiamondFontColor #E65100
    swimlaneBorderThickness 1.5
    swimlaneBorderColor #9E9E9E
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #F9A825
    FontSize 10
    FontColor #4E342E
    BorderThickness 1.0
}

skinparam partition {
    BackgroundColor #F3E5F5
    BorderColor #6A1B9A
    FontSize 12
    FontStyle bold
}

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' TITLE / HEADER / FOOTER (multi-line block form)
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

header
    **System:** OT Edge AI Platform
    **Module:** Diagnostic Workflow
    **Version:** 2.4.1
end header

footer
    Page %page% of %lastpage%
    Confidential — Internal Use Only
end footer

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' SCALE directive
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

scale 1.0

start

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 1. NOTE RIGHT / NOTE LEFT — inline single-line (floating note)
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:Action with right note;
note right: This is a right-side note

:Action with left note;
note left: This is a left-side note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 2. NOTE RIGHT / NOTE LEFT — block (multi-line)
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:Action before multi-line right note;
note right
    Multi-line right note
    spanning two lines
end note

:Action before multi-line left note;
note left
    Multi-line left note
    line one
    line two
    line three
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 3. FLOATING NOTE  (note ... end note — not attached to action)
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

note
    This is a standalone floating note.
    Not attached to any specific action.
    Parser must handle: note\n...\nend note
end note

:Continue after floating note;

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 4. COLORED NOTES  note #color
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:Action before colored notes;
note right #FF8888 : Red right note

:Another action;
note left #88FF88 : Green left note

:Yet another action;
note right #E3F2FD
    Blue multi-line note
    with color applied
end note

note left #FFF3E0
    Orange floating note
    multi-line with color
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 5. CREOLE MARKUP INSIDE NOTES
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:Trigger creole note;
note right
    **Bold text** in note
    //Italic text// in note
    ""Monospace"" in note
    --Strikethrough-- in note
    <color:red>Red text</color>
    <back:yellow>Highlighted</back>
    <size:14>Larger font</size>
    ====
    Horizontal rule above
    ----
    Another separator
    * Bullet item one
    * Bullet item two
    # Numbered item one
    # Numbered item two
end note

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 6. NOTES INSIDE CONDITIONALS
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

if (condition for note test?) then (yes)
    :True branch action;
    note right: Note inside if-true branch
    :Continue true branch;
else (no)
    :False branch action;
    note left: Note inside if-false branch
    :Continue false branch;
endif

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 7. NOTES INSIDE LOOPS
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

while (loop items remain?) is (yes)
    :Process loop item;
    note right: Note inside while loop body
    :Validate result;
endwhile (done)

repeat
    :Repeat body action;
    note left
        Multi-line note
        inside repeat body
    end note
    :Check condition;
repeat while (repeat condition?) is (no) not (yes)

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 8. NOTES INSIDE FORK
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

fork
    :Fork branch 1;
    note right: Note in fork branch 1
    :Branch 1 work;
fork again
    :Fork branch 2;
    note left
        Multi-line note
        in fork branch 2
    end note
    :Branch 2 work;
end fork

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 9. NOTES INSIDE PARTITIONS
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

partition "Partition with Notes" #E8F4FD {
    :First action in partition;
    note right: Note inside partition
    :Second action;
    note left
        Block note inside
        partition container
    end note
    :Third action;
}

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 10. STYLE BLOCK  <style>...</style>
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

' <style>
' activityDiagram {
'   activity {
'     BackgroundColor #E8F4FD
'     BorderColor #1565C0
'   }
'   diamond {
'     BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
'   }
'   arrow {
'     FontColor #444444
'   }
' }
' </style>
' (style block declared in comment to avoid rendering conflicts with skinparam above)

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 11. PRAGMA DIRECTIVES
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

' !pragma svek true
' !pragma layout smetana
' (declared in comments — grammar must parse !pragma as directive)

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 12. COMMENTS — single-line and multi-line
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

' This is a single-line comment

:Action after single-line comment;

/'
    This is a multi-line comment.
    It can span multiple lines.
    Parser must consume everything between the delimiters.
    
    :This action is commented out;
    if (this condition) then (is hidden)
        :hidden action;
    endif
'/

:Action after multi-line comment;

/' Another multi-line block '/

:Action after inline multi-line comment;

stop

note right
    **Grammar targets (notes/misc):**
    note right: text
    note left: text
    note right\n...\nend note
    note left\n...\nend note
    note\n...\nend note  (floating)
    note right #color
    Creole markup in notes
    Notes inside if/while/repeat/fork/partition
    skinparam activity { } block
    skinparam note { }
    skinparam partition { }
    header / end header
    footer / end footer
    scale N.N
    ' single-line comment
    /' multi-line comment '/
    !pragma directive
    <style>...</style>
end note

@enduml
